==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**40 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
**40 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
**40 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
**2 [[Dot Hero|Dot Heroes]] spawn, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

